  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut beetroot into wedges. Pick thyme leaves.\n• Place beetroot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over thyme and savoury seasoning, then toss to coat. Roast until tender, 30-35 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-2e0d2200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• When beetroot has 10 minutes remaining, place croutons on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-a7ba2410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While croutons are baking, thinly slice pear into wedges. Trim green beans. Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice double cream Brie.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave a good drizzle of olive oil with garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) until fragrant, 30 seconds. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-db5bf920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a large microwave-safe bowl, add green beans and a splash of water, then cover with damp paper towel.\n• Microwave green beans on high until just tender, 2-4 minutes. Drain green beans, then return to the bowl and allow to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-96954b30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To bowl with green beans, add spinach & rocket mix, pear, croutons, flaked almonds and balsamic vinaigrette dressing.\n• Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-aa58ff40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide crouton salad between bowls. Top with warm beetroot and Brie.\n• Drizzle over garlic chilli oil to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68143a9580e0f84c774d7147/step-4fb1c250.jpg"
    }
  ]
